## ⚙️ Relay Module Pin Description

| Pin | Name | Description |
|------|------|-------------|
| 1 | Relay Trigger | Input to activate the relay |
| 2 | GND | Ground connection |
| 3 | VCC | 5V power supply |
| 4 | Normally Open (NO) | Connects to load when relay is ON |
| 5 | Common (COM) | Common terminal |
| 6 | Normally Closed (NC) | Connected when relay is OFF |

### **Relay Specifications**
- Voltage: 3.75V–6V  
- Active current: ~70mA  
- Max contact voltage: 250VAC / 30VDC  
- Max current: 10A  

